    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you looking for an interesting retro-style game combined with something new? You've come to the right place!\u00a0A game created by a one-man team from a player for players!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a dangerous journey as a shinobi towards revenge, which will turn into a journey towards intrigue that threatens the entire world - it turns out that the shadow is not only an ally of a true ninja, but also a space that hides something darker.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352130/extras/75d851893f06f7ce7b0c2c02e72982e0.poster.avif?t=1750957553\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352130/extras/75d851893f06f7ce7b0c2c02e72982e0.webm?t=1750957553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352130/extras/75d851893f06f7ce7b0c2c02e72982e0.mp4?t=1750957553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight exciting duels,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>hide in the shadows for stealth kills,</strong> <br><strong>sneak like a shinobi!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this 2D game in a pixel and cartoon style, you will use stealth and combat mechanics depending on the need.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you looking for an interesting retro-style game combined with something new? You've come to the right place!\u00a0A game created by a one-man team from a player for players!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a dangerous journey as a shinobi towards revenge, which will turn into a journey towards intrigue that threatens the entire world - it turns out that the shadow is not only an ally of a true ninja, but also a space that hides something darker.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352130/extras/75d851893f06f7ce7b0c2c02e72982e0.poster.avif?t=1750957553\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352130/extras/75d851893f06f7ce7b0c2c02e72982e0.webm?t=1750957553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352130/extras/75d851893f06f7ce7b0c2c02e72982e0.mp4?t=1750957553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight exciting duels,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>hide in the shadows for stealth kills,</strong> <br><strong>sneak like a shinobi!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this 2D game in a pixel and cartoon style, you will use stealth and combat mechanics depending on the need.</strong></p>",
